# EAS archives from the git root, so exclude everything that isn't the mobile
# app. The ml-research tree (ESC-50 dataset, spectrogram caches, trained models,
# denoised WAVs) is multiple GB and irrelevant to the Android build — including
# it made the upload tarball 654 MB and the upload kept dropping (ECONNRESET).

# --- Non-mobile parts of the repo (not needed to build the app) ---
ml-research/
services/
docs/
demo/

# --- Large/binary artifacts anywhere (the bundled *.tflite model is KEPT) ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.wav
*.m4a
*.keras
*.tflite.bak
*.ndjson
*.log

# --- Node / Expo ---
node_modules/
.expo/
.tunnels/

# --- Generated Android build artifacts (Windows abs paths break EAS's Linux
# workers; the worker regenerates them). ---
mobile/android/build/
mobile/android/.gradle/
mobile/android/.kotlin/
mobile/android/app/build/
mobile/android/app/.cxx/
